  "historyNote": "#7874-B, eff 4-18-03; ss by #8987-A, eff 9-24-07); ss by #9538, eff 9-8-09); ss by #9538, eff 9-8-09; ss by #10625-B, eff 6-26-14; ss by #13711-B, eff 8-2-23",
